## 1. The @RestController method mapped to POST /api/owners

The actual HTTP mapping lives in the OpenAPI-generated interface `OwnersApi`; the controller `OwnerRestControllerV1` implements it and `@Override`s `addOwner`.

### Class + mapping declaration
