So the effective route is class-level `@RequestMapping("/api")` + interface `"/owners"` = **POST /api/owners**, `@Valid @RequestBody OwnerFieldsDto`.

### Controller class header
`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/controller/v1/OwnerRestControllerV1.java` (lines 67-70)
