## 2. The request DTO used as @RequestBody — `OwnerFieldsDto` with all Bean Validation annotations

`/home/daniel/sandbox/target/generated-sources/openapi/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/dto/OwnerFieldsDto.java`

Per-field validation constraints (from the getters, which is where the annotations sit):

| Field | Line | Constraints |
|---|---|---|
| `firstName` | 121 | `@NotNull @Pattern(regexp = "^[\\p{L}]+([ '-][\\p{L}]+){0,2}$") @Size(min = 1, max = 30)` |
| `lastName` | 142 | `@NotNull @Pattern(regexp = "^[\\p{L}]+([ '-][\\p{L}]+){0,2}\\.?$") @Size(min = 1, max = 30)` |
| `title` (enum MR/MRS/MS/DR) | 163-166 | none (optional enum) |
| `address` | 184 | `@Size(min = 1, max = 255)` |
| `addressLine1` | 205 | `@Size(max = 255)` |
| `addressLine2` | 226 | `@Size(max = 255)` |
| `city` | 247 | `@NotNull @Size(min = 1, max = 80)` |
| `telephone` | 268 | `@NotNull @Size(min = 1, max = 20)` |
| `email` | 289 | `@Size(min = 1, max = 255) @jakarta.validation.constraints.Email` |
