## 5. Repository methods + Owner entity/JPA mapping

### Repository interface
`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/repository/OwnerRepository.java` — methods used: `save(Owner)` (line 75), `findAll()` (line 83), `findById(int)` (line 66).

